   "text": "\ud83d\udcb8 Toronto, Canada based Radical Ventures recently raised over US$1 billion in commitments at first close for Radical Breakouts Fund. LPs include PSP Investments | Investissements PSP, CPP Investments | Investissements RPC, TD, BMO, CI Global Asset Management, OPTrust, and others \n\n\ud83d\udca1 Invest in late-stage AI scale-ups building the next generation of category-defining companies on a path toward becoming trillion-dollar businesses \n\n\ud83c\udf0d#Canada #UnitedStates #Europe \n\n\ud83d\udcc8 Portfolio companies include Cohere, Waabi, World Labs, DiscoveryLoop, Xanadu, Aspect Biosystems, Etched, Crusoe, among others \n\n\ud83d\udcad\"We compete to invest and partner with the best AI founders and companies in the world, and we win.\" \u2014 ",
