   "added": 1792805703
  },
  "7519494780561641472": {
   "created": 1792787261,
   "author": "Augment",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/augmentmarkets_the-augment-power-20-q326-activity-7519494780561641472-v0Os",
   "text": "The top of the list got thinner and the AI share got wider. That's the story of the Augment Power 20 for Q3'26.\n\nThe six highest-ranked Power 20 names accounted for 16.2% of all activity on Augment in Q3, the lowest share ever and down from 47% in Q1. In the same quarter, AI companies made up 67.1% of activity among the 20 ranked names, a new high.\n\nEtched led price gains at +152% and ranked second in demand growth. Prometheus was the most active company on the platform. Impulse Space, Hadrian and Blue Origin posted the largest increases in buy-side orders quarter over quarter, so space and manufacturing names took three of the top four demand spots in a quarter dominated by AI.\n\nThe six cha",
   "disc_score": 9,
