  "7519495849844969472": {
   "created": 1792787516,
   "author": "Noel Moldvai",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/noelmoldvai_something-i-keep-looking-at-from-our-q3-power-activity-7519495849844969472-2RBf",
   "text": "Something I keep looking at from our Q3 Power 20 data. The six highest ranked names were 47% of all activity on Augment in Q1 and 16.2% in Q3, which is the lowest share we've seen since we started tracking these metrics  in late 2023.\n\nThat's share, not dollars, so the top names are still plenty active, it's just that a much bigger chunk of the orders are now going to the rest of the names on the list. Etched, Hadrian, Impulse Space and Blue Origin had the biggest jumps in buy-side demand quarter over quarter, and three of those four build physical things, which is not the list I would have guessed in January.\n\nMy read is that this is what broader participation across the private market look",
   "disc_score": 16,
